One day, while working on the project, Jenny experiences a particularly stressful situation where a key team member unexpectedly quits, leaving her with a significant workload to manage. She starts feeling intense abdominal pain and has to take a break to go to the bathroom multiple times. Her symptoms persist for several days, and she eventually seeks medical attention. Her doctor tells her that her IBS has been exacerbated by the excessive stress from her job, and advises her to take time off work to rest and recover. <|endoftext|>
