In this example, we first load and preprocess the data using the `LoadData` and `PreprocessData` methods. We then train a machine learning model using the `TrainModel` method and use it to predict trends for the upcoming winter season using the `PredictTrends` method. Finally, we create a line chart using the `Chart` class and save it as an image using the `SaveImage` method. <|endoftext|>
