Can you provide a detailed report in an HTML page format that highlights the recent policy announcement made by the US Postal Service regarding paid parental leave policy?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
Certainly, here is the requested report in HTML page format:

US Postal Service Paid Parental Leave Policy Announcement

 body {
 font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
 margin: 20px;
 }
 h1, h2 {
 text-align: center;
 }
