Welcome to the restaurant suggestion challenge! Here are the dietary restrictions of our customer: no gluten, no dairy, and no soy. In addition to these restrictions, the customer is craving grilled fish. The application must go through a multi-faceted decision-making process to suggest the best restaurant. 
The first factor to consider is proximity to the customer's location. The restaurant must be within a certain distance to be considered. Secondly, customer reviews and ratings will be taken into account. The restaurant with the best customer feedback will be given more weightage. 
Next, the restaurant's menu will be examined for the availability of grilled fish. Only restaurants that serve grilled fish will be considered. Finally, the restaurant's ability to accommodate the customer's dietary restrictions will be evaluated. 
After weighing all of these factors, the application will suggest the best restaurant that meets the customer's needs. Can you help us in suggesting the perfect restaurant for this customer?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
Of course! Let's start by finding restaurants that are within the customer's preferred distance and serve grilled fish. Based on the customer's dietary restrictions, we can filter out restaurants that do not offer gluten-free, dairy-free, and soy-free options. 
