1. Seasons 52 - This restaurant is known for its fresh and seasonal menu items. They offer a gluten-free and dairy-free menu, and their wood-grilled seafood options include grilled salmon and trout. 
2. True Food Kitchen - This restaurant offers a variety of gluten-free, dairy-free, and soy-free options. They have a grilled fish dish called the "Organic Grilled Salmon," which is served with asparagus, cauliflower mash, and herb vinaigrette. 
