In what ways can the HTML page be enhanced to provide a more detailed breakdown of the cost savings achieved through remote work? How can we expand the R script provided below to include additional factors such as reduced employee turnover rates and increased productivity? Furthermore, can we incorporate visual aids such as graphs and charts to better illustrate the data on the HTML page? 
[R code]
# Define variables for cost savings calculation
commute_distance <- 20 # in miles
commute_frequency <- 5 # days per week
gas_price <- 3.00 # per gallon
office_rent <- 2000 # per month
number_of_employees <- 10
employee_turnover_rate <- 0.1 # per year
average_salary <- 50000 # per year
productivity_increase <- 0.05 # percent increase in productivity
# Calculate cost savings for employees
gas_saved <- commute_distance * commute_frequency * (52 / 12) * (1 / 25) # assuming 25 miles per gallon
commuting_savings <- gas_saved * gas_price
office_savings <- (office_rent / number_of_employees) * (1 / 22) # assuming 22 working days in a month
total_savings_employee <- commuting_savings + office_savings + (employee_turnover_rate * average_salary)
total_savings_employee <- total_savings_employee * (1 + productivity_increase)
# Calculate cost savings for employers
total_office_space_saved <- number_of_employees * 100 # assuming 100 sq. ft. per employee
total_office_rent_saved <- total_office_space_saved * (office_rent / 1000) # assuming $20 per sq. ft. rent
total_savings_employer <- total_office_rent_saved + (employee_turnover_rate * average_salary * number_of_employees)
total_savings_employer <- total_savings_employer * (1 + productivity_increase)
# Display results on HTML page with graphs and charts
Enhanced Remote Work Cost Savings Calculator
Enhanced Remote Work Cost Savings Calculator
============================================
Employee Cost Savings
---------------------
* Commuting Savings: $[commuting_savings]
* Office Space Savings: $[office_savings]
* Reduced Turnover Cost: $[employee_turnover_rate * average_salary]
* Increased Productivity: $[total_savings_employee * productivity_increase]
* Total Savings: $[total_savings_employee]
Employer Cost Savings
---------------------
* Office Space Savings: $[total_office_rent_saved]
* Reduced Turnover Cost: $[employee_turnover_rate * average_salary * number_of_employees]
* Increased Productivity: $[total_savings_employer * productivity_increase]
* Total Savings: $[total_savings_employer]
![Commuting Savings Graph](https://www.example.com/graphs/commuting_savings.jpg)
![Office Space Savings Graph](https://www.example.com/graphs/office_space_savings.jpg)
![Productivity Increase Graph](https://www.example.com/graphs/productivity_increase.jpg)
<|end|>
