To expand the R script, you could add additional factors such as reduced absenteeism and sick days, or reduced healthcare costs. You could also factor in the cost savings of not having to provide office equipment or supplies for remote workers. Additionally, you could consider the cost savings of reduced carbon emissions and environmental impact.
To incorporate visual aids, you could create graphs and charts to better illustrate the data on the HTML page. For example, you could create a pie chart showing the breakdown of cost savings between commuting savings, office space savings, and reduced turnover costs. You could also create a line graph showing the increase in productivity over time, or a bar graph showing the cost savings achieved by each individual employee. These visual aids would help to make the data more accessible and understandable for users. <|endoftext|>
