In addition to the given requirements, you must ensure that the total area of the circles is greater than the total area of the triangles. Can you find a way to arrange the objects satisfying both requirements? Remember to maintain the alternating pattern of colors and shapes while arranging the objects. Hint: You can start by arranging the objects based on their colors or shapes and then adjust the order based on the total area of the circles and triangles.
