1. Excellent Customer Service - Providing excellent customer service is key to building strong relationships with customers. This includes things like responding to inquiries and complaints promptly and resolving issues quickly and effectively.

2. Consistent Branding - Building a strong, consistent brand helps to establish trust and credibility with customers. This includes everything from your company's visual identity (logo, color scheme, etc.) to the tone of voice used in your marketing materials.

3. Community Building - Creating a sense of community around your brand can help to foster loyalty among your customers. This can include things like hosting events or creating online forums where customers can connect with each other.

4. Seamless User Experience - Ensuring that your website and mobile app are easy to navigate and use can go a long way in improving customer satisfaction and fostering loyalty.

5. Personalized Surprises - Offering personalized surprises to customers can make them feel valued and appreciated. This can include everything from surprise discounts on their birthday to unexpected gifts with purchase.

