 text-align: center;
}
h1 {
 font-size: 2em;
 margin-bottom: 1em;
}
#question {
 font-size: 1.5em;
 margin-bottom: 1em;
}
#choices {
 display: flex;
 flex-wrap: wrap;
 justify-content: center;
 margin-bottom: 1em;
}
button {
 font-size: 1.2em;
 margin: 0.5em;
 padding: 0.5em 1em;
 border: none;
 border-radius: 0.5em;
 background-color: #eee;
 cursor: pointer;
}
button:hover {
 background-color: #ddd;
}
#submit {
 margin-bottom: 1em;
}
#submit button {
 margin: 0 0.5em;
}
#results {
 font-size: 1.5em;
 margin-bottom: 1em;
}
```
This code generates an interactive quiz with three scenario-based questions, a dynamic scoring system, and randomized options. It also allows the user to move back and forth between questions effortlessly and displays the correct answer after each question. The score is displayed in a visually stunning manner, and a structured table can store the questions, options, and answers, ensuring scalability and easy maintenance of the quiz. <|endoftext|>
