 "Spanish": "El perro está ladrando fuerte",
 "French": "Le chien aboie bruyamment",
 "German": "Der Hund bellt laut"
}
```
To output only the translation in Spanish, French, and German, you can modify the code to access each translation individually and output it separately. Here's an example:
```
#include 
#include 
int main()
{
 Json::Value translation;
 translation["English"] = "The dog is barking loudly";
 translation["Spanish"] = "El perro está ladrando fuerte";
 translation["French"] = "Le chien aboie bruyamment";
