3. Write a poem about a childhood memory.
4. Write a story about a character who wakes up with no memory of the previous day, but discovers they have committed a crime.
5. Write a scene that involves a dispute between two characters over a mundane object, such as a pencil or a coffee mug.
6. Write a story that takes place entirely in one room.
7. Write a story that features a character who has a unique ability to communicate with animals.
