During a presentation on the topic, the speaker introduces a complex technical concept that Alice and Bob have different opinions on. The speaker uses a table to explain the concept, but Alice and Bob still have trouble understanding it due to the language barrier.
Alice suggests that they work together to understand the concept better. She creates a chart that breaks down the concept into smaller parts and uses visual aids to help explain it. Bob is impressed with Alice's creativity and agrees to work together.
