<|user|>
Can you help me solve a riddle about the Resplendent Quetzal, an extinct avian species? I have a table below with several mathematical equations that represent the possible causes of their extinction. Only one equation is correct. Can you use your logical reasoning skills to determine which equation caused the demise of the Resplendent Quetzal? 
Equation | Potential Cause 
-------- | ---------------
3x + 4y | Habitat loss 
5x - 2y | Overhunting 
2x + 3y | Disease 
7x - 3y | Climate change 
[Go code]
func solveEquation(equation string) string {
 //parse equation string to extract coefficients
 var xCoeff, yCoeff int
 fmt.Sscanf(equation, "%dx + %dy", &xCoeff, &yCoeff)
 
 //evaluate equation for x=2 and y=3
 result := (xCoeff*2) + (yCoeff*3)
 
 //determine if result matches a potential cause
 if result == 9 {
 return "Habitat loss"
 } else if result == 16 {
 return "Overhunting"
 } else if result == 13 {
 return "Disease"
 } else if result == 5 {
 return "Climate change"
 } else {
 return "Unknown cause"
 }
}
[/Go code]
After determining the correct equation, we can use the above Go code to evaluate the equation and find the potential cause of extinction. Once we have identified the cause of extinction for the Resplendent Quetzal, we can compare it to other extinct avian species in the same region and analyze any similarities or differences. Can you help me with this task?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
Sure, I would be happy to help you. Can you provide me with any additional information about the Resplendent Quetzal and its habitat? <|endoftext|>
