| White sugar | 3/4 cup |
| Brown sugar | 1/4 cup |
| All-purpose flour | 1/4 cup |
| Ground cinnamon | 1 teaspoon |
| Nutmeg | 1/4 teaspoon |
| Salt | 1/4 teaspoon |
| Unsalted butter | 2 tablespoons |
| Lemon juice | 1 tablespoon |
| Unbaked 9 inch pie crust | 1 |
| Egg | 1 |
In the excel table, you can easily adjust the quantities of the ingredients based on the number of servings you need. Once you have the ingredients and instructions in the excel table, you can easily refer to it as you prepare the apple pie. <|endoftext|>
<|end|>
<|user|>
Can you suggest some variations or additions to the basic apple pie recipe?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
Sure! Here are a few variations and additions you can try:
- Add some chopped nuts, such as pecans or walnuts, to the topping for a crunchy texture.
- Mix in some dried cranberries or raisins for an extra burst of sweetness.
- Swap out the cinnamon for pumpkin pie spice for a different flavor profile.
- Create a streusel topping by mixing together flour, brown sugar, oats, and butter, and sprinkle it over the top of the pie before baking.
- Drizzle some caramel sauce over the top of the finished pie for added richness.
- Make miniature pies by using a muffin tin instead of a pie dish, and top each one with a dollop of whipped cream. <|endoftext|>
<|end|>
<|user|>
How can I make a vegan apple pie?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
There are several substitutions you can make to turn the basic apple pie recipe into a vegan version:
- Use a vegan-friendly pie crust, which can be found at many grocery stores or made from scratch using vegetable shortening instead of butter.
- Instead of using butter, substitute with vegan margarine or coconut oil.
- To replace the egg wash on the top crust, use a mixture of non-dairy milk (such as soy or almond milk) and maple syrup.
- Use cornstarch or arrowroot powder instead of flour to thicken the filling.
- Check that the white sugar used is vegan as some brands may use bone char during refining.
- Finally, you can also incorporate some vegan vanilla ice cream or whipped cream as toppings to serve alongside the pie. <|endoftext|>
<|end|>


