<|end|>
<|asst|>
Running a marathon in the desert is ranked first because it involves extreme physical endurance due to the harsh conditions of the desert environment. The high temperatures, arid climate, and lack of shade can quickly dehydrate runners and put them at risk for heat exhaustion or even heatstroke. Therefore, it requires intense physical training and preparation to run a marathon in the desert. <|endoftext|>
<|end|>
<|user|>
What makes climbing Mount Everest the most expensive challenge according to the given criteria?
<|end|>
