How can we use Java to create a website for a new restaurant that has a menu and reservation system, along with an online ordering system? Can you provide sample code that incorporates these features and ensures smooth functionality?
Furthermore, how can we improve the user experience by adding interactive elements like a photo gallery, customer reviews, and virtual tours of the restaurant? Can you suggest some Java code snippets that could help us achieve this goal?
