Your code looks correct! It uses the `findall()` method to search for all elements in the XML document that contain the term "Dim Sum" in their text content. The XPath query `".//*[contains(text(),'Dim Sum')]"` matches any element (`*`) in the document (`//`) that contains the string "Dim Sum" in its text content. Then, it prints the text content of each matching element using the `text` attribute. <|endoftext|>
<|end|>
